## 🚀 Getting Started

### How to Play

1. **Open the file** — Download `task_compass.html` and open it in any modern web browser
2. **No installation needed** — Everything runs offline, completely self-contained
3. **Start the game** — Click "Begin the Journey" on the title screen
4. **Play three stages** — 3 questions per stage, 9 total challenges
5. **Receive insights** — Get a personalized reflection on your organizational understanding

### Game Duration
- ~10–15 minutes total
- 3 minutes per stage

