## 📊 Scoring & Reflection

Instead of a traditional score, Task Compass measures your understanding across four categories:

- **Ownership** — How well you identify primary responsibility
- **Delegation** — How well you route work through organizations
- **Collaboration** — How well you recognize team interdependencies
- **Workflow Thinking** — Overall organizational comprehension

Your results are visualized as a **bar chart** showing your performance in each area. You'll also receive personalized insights:

- What you understood well
- Where you tended to over-assign responsibility
- Where you underestimated collaboration
- One key insight about how organizations actually work

